  "reviewedCorrespondence": [
    "read_request retains existing closed4M source schema, duplicate-key checked JSON and exact interface validation. prepare and inspection share this parser; the inspector independently prepares original catalog/policy/query profile and SQL resolution with parameter expansion preflight.",
    "SecurityBackendContext::new remains crate-private. The public inspector constructs genuine owner objects locally and delegates to existing context.check_result_cells; no forged context fields or alternate semantic interpreter are introduced.",
    "Existing declaration validation runs against exact resolved output names/positions/source fields, original normalized transformation classes and complete rule provenance. Contract bytes are hashed as supplied then parsed and compared with the typed declaration; batch hash is bound to those exact bytes.",
    "The optional diagnostic probe is closed to four members and constructs one original declaration column. Classes aggregate all emitted rule provenance under canonical class IDs; the first retained class literal is representative while cells may carry any original-normalized equivalent literal.",
    "52 independent pure controls passed through actual diagnostic and direct-API harness: typed position/name/source/outcome/transform/provenance drift; exact retained byte/hash behavior; batch/source/query/probe/cell drift; normalized equivalent and conflicting classes; rows4096 pass/4097 refuse. All expected failures produced empty stdout in the tested executable surfaces.",
    "Contract whitespace with refreshed exact hash passes; whitespace with stale hash refuses. Equivalent0/-0 and1/1e0 cells pass their original classes, mismatched class constants refuse.",
    "Parent native focused9.354s and expanded9.233s runs pass for genuine first/second projected cells in equivalent0/-0 and distinct1/2 cases, forged values and selected malformed cells. Existing six mapping transport unit tests pass."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No authenticated issuer/profile/principal, held source/authority cut, native physical-plan admission, complete result selection, protected execution or publication/release authority is established.",
    "The inspector intentionally checks correspondence: empty rows and source-declared withheld cells can pass without evaluating a fact cut or rule truths. Such success is not authorization or proof of row completeness.",
    "The diagnostic probe constructs one-column declarations only; no multi-column execution/result transport qualification is claimed.",
    "Original request source admission and selected parameter preflight are shared with existing mapping preparation; typed contract/batch limits remain those of the original result checkers. Outer probe serialization is bounded by existing diagnostic input/output ceilings, not a total CPU/process/native heap proof.",
    "The temporary harness copies diagnostic contract construction only to inject direct API refusals and links the actual unchanged core implementation. It does not emulate native PostgreSQL.",
    "No backend acceptance case or security-ready status is promoted."
  ]
}
